  "id": "power-transformation",
  "term": "power transformation",
  "definition": "In this packet, power transformation refers to a statistical way of modifying a probability distribution so it can better represent the pattern of cognitive test scores. Here, an alpha power transformation was used to create a model that fit students’ right-skewed mathematics achievement scores better than several comparison distributions.",
